Team Member
Frank Wember

README

Ensure that the game panel is set to Full HD (1920 x 1080) for optimal display.

Game Features & Updates:
1. Green apples now instantly end the game if caught.
2. The falling speed of red and green apples gradually increases as the player's score rises.
3. The start screen has been redesigned with a visually engaging Apple Tree background, featuring falling apples along with “About Game”, "Start Game", and “Quit Game” buttons.
4. An “About Game” section has been introduced, providing a clear overview of the objective and gameplay mechanics.